# Merge these lines into .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the handle with the CTO's.
# Branch protection on the default branch must also have:
#   - Require a pull request before merging
#   - Require review from Code Owners
#   - Dismiss stale pull request approvals when new commits are pushed
#   - Require approval of the most recent reviewable push
# Then nothing below changes (no new rule, threshold, goal or blocking switch)
# until the CTO approves it.
/.github/                    @CTO-HANDLE
/.github/CODEOWNERS          @CTO-HANDLE
/.gitattributes              @CTO-HANDLE
/openspec/config.yaml        @CTO-HANDLE
/openspec/schemas/           @CTO-HANDLE
/openspec/goals.md           @CTO-HANDLE
# Agent and editor configuration; some of it can run commands on a developer's machine.
/.mcp.json                   @CTO-HANDLE
/.claude/                    @CTO-HANDLE
/.cursor/                    @CTO-HANDLE
/.vscode/                    @CTO-HANDLE
/.devcontainer/              @CTO-HANDLE
/.husky/                     @CTO-HANDLE
AGENTS.md                    @CTO-HANDLE
CLAUDE.md                    @CTO-HANDLE
